msgid "Reproducibility and Generalizability in Diffusion Models"
msgstr "diffusion 模型中的可复现性与泛化性"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:13
msgid ""
"With the same initial noise and deterministic sampling, paired outputs become more "
"stable and less train-near as the CIFAR-10 training set grows."
msgstr "在相同初始噪声和确定性采样下，随着 CIFAR-10 训练集规模扩大，成对输出会更稳定，也会远离训练样本。"

