#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:39
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "摘要"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:42
msgid ""
"This example probes the same-noise reproducibility phenomenon reported by Zhang et "
"al. Two CIFAR-10 DDPMs share their initialization, data subset, and sampler noise; "
"only training-seed randomness differs. Across data sizes, paired samples move from "
"unstable train-set memorization to fine-grained, less-train-near agreement. This is a"
" controlled qualitative reproduction, not a replication of the paper's full "
"architecture, seed, or dataset sweep."
msgstr ""
"本示例考察 Zhang 等人报告的同噪声可复现现象。两个 CIFAR-10 DDPM 共享初始化、数据子集和采样器噪声；"
"仅训练 seed 的随机性不同。随着数据规模增大，成对样本从不稳定的训练集记忆转向细粒度且远离训练样本的一致性。"
"这是受控的定性复现，并非复刻论文完整的架构、seed 或数据集扫描。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:50
msgid ""
"**Paper:** [The Emergence of Reproducibility and Generalizability in Diffusion "
"Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.05264), Huijie Zhang, Jinfan Zhou, Yifu Lu, Minzhe"
" Guo, Peng Wang, Liyue Shen, and Qing Qu (ICML 2024)"
msgstr ""
"**论文：** [The Emergence of Reproducibility and Generalizability in Diffusion "
"Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.05264)，Huijie Zhang、Jinfan Zhou、Yifu Lu、Minzhe "
"Guo、Peng Wang、Liyue Shen 和 Qing Qu（ICML 2024）"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:54
msgid "**Template:** `repro: Diffusion same-init / different-seed`"
msgstr "**模板：** `repro: Diffusion same-init / different-seed`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:56
msgid "**Template ID:** `repro-diffusion-same-init-different-seed`"
msgstr "**模板 ID：** `repro-diffusion-same-init-different-seed`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:58
msgid "Reproduction Goal"
msgstr "复现目标"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:60
msgid ""
"The paper reports that independently trained diffusion models can produce similar "
"outputs when given the same starting noise and a deterministic sampler. It interprets"
" this as evidence that reproducibility can occur in both a memorization regime and a "
"generalization regime."
msgstr "论文指出：给定相同的起始噪声和确定性采样器时，独立训练的 diffusion 模型可以生成相似的输出。论文将此解释为：可复现性既可出现在记忆阶段，也可出现在泛化阶段。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:65
msgid ""
"This graph asks a narrower question: when all conditions except training seed are "
"fixed, how do paired output agreement and proximity to the training set change with "
"the number of CIFAR-10 training examples? We compare the two deterministic maps "
"generated by the endpoints, rather than claiming that their score functions are "
"identical."
msgstr ""
"该图聚焦一个更窄的问题：当除训练 seed 外的所有条件都固定时，成对输出的一致程度以及与训练集的接近程度，会如何随 "
"CIFAR-10 训练样本数变化？我们比较两个端点生成的确定性映射，并不声称它们的 score function 完全相同。"

