"Choose a `trainSize` and matching training-step budget. The editable default is the "
"4,096-image, 5k-step smoke configuration."
msgstr "选择 `trainSize` 及相应的训练步数预算。可编辑的默认值为 4,096 张图像、5k 步的 smoke 配置。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:109
