"Keep the dataset subset, UNet initialization, optimizer, and sampler noise fixed. Set"
" the two Trainer seeds to 0 and 1."
msgstr "保持数据集子集、UNet 初始化、优化器和采样器噪声固定。将两个 Trainer seed 设为 0 和 1。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:111
