"Run paired similarity and RP/SSCD. Run nearest-train GL for each sampler to "
"distinguish paired agreement from simple training-image proximity."
msgstr "运行成对相似度和 RP/SSCD。对每个采样器运行最近训练样本 GL，以区分成对一致性与单纯接近训练图像的情形。"

