#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:127
msgid ""
"The five historical Comfy Research runs make the metric trends directly inspectable. "
"Each canvas contains the two endpoint workflows, deterministic sample grids, paired "
"similarity, RP/SSCD, and nearest-train comparisons."
msgstr "Comfy Research 的五次历史运行使指标趋势可直接查看。每个画布均包含两个端点工作流、确定性样本网格、成对相似度、RP/SSCD 和最近训练样本比较。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:131
msgid ""
"Comfy Research evidence canvas for the 512-image, 20k-step diffusion run, showing "
"divergent same-noise sample pairs and train-near nearest-train matches."
msgstr "Comfy Research 中 512 张图像、20k 步 diffusion 运行的证据画布，展示了分歧的同噪声样本对及接近训练样本的最近训练匹配。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:135
msgid ""
"**512 images, 20k steps.** The endpoints both overfit, but their same-noise outputs "
"remain visibly unstable across training seeds."
msgstr "**512 张图像，20k 步。** 两个端点都过拟合，但其同噪声输出在不同训练 seed 下仍明显不稳定。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:139
msgid ""
"Comfy Research evidence canvas for the 4096-image, 5k-step diffusion run, showing "
"high RP similarity with visibly different paired samples."
msgstr "Comfy Research 中 4,096 张图像、5k 步 diffusion 运行的证据画布，展示了高 RP 相似度及肉眼可见差异的成对样本。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:143
msgid ""
"**4,096 images, 5k steps.** RP is already high, while paired samples still differ in "
"fine detail and spatial arrangement."
msgstr "**4,096 张图像，5k 步。** RP 已很高，但成对样本在精细细节和空间布局上仍有差异。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:147
msgid ""
"Comfy Research evidence canvas for the 4096-image, 20k-step diffusion run, showing "
"coarse same-noise agreement and nearest-train comparisons."
msgstr "Comfy Research 中 4,096 张图像、20k 步 diffusion 运行的证据画布，展示了粗粒度的同噪声一致性和最近训练样本比较。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:151
msgid ""
"**4,096 images, 20k steps.** The transition regime has stable coarse content, but "
"remains closer to training images than the large-data regime."
msgstr "**4,096 张图像，20k 步。** 过渡阶段的粗粒度内容稳定，但仍比大数据阶段更接近训练图像。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:155
msgid ""
"Comfy Research evidence canvas for the 32768-image, 20k-step diffusion run, showing "
"closely aligned paired samples and higher nearest-train GL."
msgstr "Comfy Research 中 32,768 张图像、20k 步 diffusion 运行的证据画布，展示了高度对齐的成对样本和更高的最近训练 GL。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:159
msgid ""
"**32,768 images, 20k steps.** Same-noise outputs align closely while nearest-train GL"
" is substantially higher."
msgstr "**32,768 张图像，20k 步。** 同噪声输出高度对齐，最近训练 GL 则显著更高。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:163
msgid ""
"Comfy Research evidence canvas for the 32768-image, 10k-step diffusion run, showing "
"early stable same-noise correspondence."
msgstr "Comfy Research 中 32,768 张图像、10k 步 diffusion 运行的证据画布，展示了早期即稳定的同噪声对应关系。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:167
msgid ""
"**32,768 images, 10k steps.** The correspondence is already stable before the final "
"training budget, indicating that later optimization mainly refines it."
msgstr "**32,768 张图像，10k 步。** 对应关系在最终训练步数之前已趋于稳定，表明后续优化主要是在细化它。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:171
msgid "The additional step sweep sharpens this picture:"
msgstr "额外的训练步数扫描进一步澄清了这一图景："

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:173
msgid ""
"For 512 examples, longer training does not repair the paired map: RP falls from 0.497"
" at 5k to 0.402 at 20k, while GL remains near zero."
msgstr "对于 512 个样本，更长训练不能修复成对映射：RP 从 5k 时的 0.497 降至 20k 时的 0.402，而 GL 仍接近零。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:175
msgid ""
"For 4,096 examples, RP can be high before images are closely aligned: at 5k, RP is "
"0.998 while MAE is still 0.147. Feature-level similarity therefore saturates before "
"fine-grained paired agreement."
msgstr ""
"对于 4,096 个样本，在图像高度对齐前 RP 就可能很高：5k 时 RP 为 0.998，而 MAE 仍为 "
"0.147。因此，特征层面的相似度会先于细粒度的成对一致性饱和。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:178
msgid ""
"For 32,768 examples, the correspondence stabilizes early: at 10k, MAE is 0.056 and RP"
" is already 1.0, close to the 20k result."
msgstr "对于 32,768 个样本，对应关系很早就稳定：10k 时 MAE 为 0.056，RP 已为 1.0，接近 20k 的结果。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:181
msgid "Interpretation"
msgstr "解释"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:183
msgid "The results support three setting-specific observations."
msgstr "结果支持以下三项与设置相关的观察。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:185
msgid ""
"**Memorization does not imply reproducibility.** With 512 examples, both endpoints "
"overfit and generate train-near samples, but the same-noise assignment differs across"
" training seeds. Continued training strengthens model-specific memorization rather "
"than aligning a shared map."
msgstr ""
"**记忆不意味着可复现性。** 对于 512 个样本，两个端点都会过拟合并生成接近训练集的样本，但同噪声对应关系会随训练 "
"seed 而变化。继续训练强化的是模型特有的记忆，而非对齐共享映射。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:189
msgid ""
"**Reproducibility develops with data scale.** The 4,096-image regime is an "
"intermediate state: coarse feature agreement is high, yet paired pixels and "
"perceptual details still differ."
msgstr "**可复现性随数据规模发展。** 4,096 张图像的阶段是中间状态：粗粒度特征一致性较高，但成对像素和感知细节仍不相同。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:192
msgid ""
"**Large-data reproducibility is consistent with generalization.** At 32,768 images, "
"paired MAE and LPIPS are lowest while GL is substantially higher and train/test "
"losses are close. The agreement is therefore not explained only by nearest-training-"
"image copying."
msgstr ""
"**大数据下的可复现性与泛化一致。** 在 32,768 张图像时，成对 MAE 和 LPIPS 最低，GL 明显更高，且训练/测试损失接近。"
"因此，这种一致性不能仅归因于复制最近的训练图像。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:197
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "局限性"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:199
msgid ""
"The study compares two same-init, different-seed endpoints only; it does not test the"
" paper's broader architecture or independent-initialization claims."
msgstr "本研究只比较两个同初始化、不同 seed 的端点；并未检验论文中更广泛的架构或独立初始化结论。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:201
msgid "The setting is CIFAR-10 with one DDPM and one deterministic sampler."
msgstr "该设置使用 CIFAR-10、一个 DDPM 和一个确定性采样器。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:202
msgid ""
"RP/SSCD, MAE, LPIPS, and nearest-train GL measure different aspects of the "
"phenomenon; none alone establishes full distributional equivalence."
msgstr "RP/SSCD、MAE、LPIPS 和最近训练样本 GL 衡量现象的不同方面；没有一个能够单独建立完全的分布等价性。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/diffusion-reproducibility.md:204
msgid ""
"The observed trend is empirical evidence in this controlled setting, not a proof that"
" the learned score functions coincide."
msgstr "观察到的趋势是该受控设置中的实证证据，并不能证明学得的 score function 一致。"
